WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.740
And they want the factories to stop.

00:01.740 --> 00:02.880
Everything should stop.

00:02.880 --> 00:03.780
No more cows.

00:03.780 --> 00:04.900
We don't want cows anymore.

00:04.900 --> 00:06.320
I guess they want to kill all the cows.

00:06.320 --> 00:08.520
They want to do things that are just unbelievable.

00:08.520 --> 00:10.400
And you have it too.

